WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,830 --> 00:00:03,730
It's you

2
00:00:11,290 --> 00:00:12,770
There is barbecue to eat tonight

3
00:00:13,890 --> 00:00:16,410
I have a good meal today, old man

4
00:00:16,410 --> 00:00:18,530
That was a wild boar that was killed by a certain family and put down by a certain family.

5
00:00:18,530 --> 00:00:19,610
Where did the freak come from?

6
00:00:19,610 --> 00:00:20,650
He grew up so quickly

7
00:00:20,650 --> 00:00:22,330
Rushan wearing a Wenzhouzhou outfit

8
00:00:22,850 --> 00:00:25,290
Why are you pretending to be a scholar?

9
00:00:25,290 --> 00:00:26,450
Who do you think is pretending to be a scholar?

10
00:00:26,450 --> 00:00:28,010
I can't give you a given name or change my surname.

11
00:00:28,010 --> 00:00:29,010
It’s Her Royal Highness the eldest princess

12
00:00:29,010 --> 00:00:30,890
The real card he wields is the Mao family that follows the army

13
00:00:30,890 --> 00:00:32,450
A true reader

14
00:00:32,450 --> 00:00:33,650
Return the wild boar to me

15
00:00:33,650 --> 00:00:35,130
That was killed by me with one punch.

16
00:00:35,130 --> 00:00:36,330
Do you dare to grab one and try it?

17
00:00:36,330 --> 00:00:38,370
A strong man with well-developed limbs and a simple mind

18
00:00:38,370 --> 00:00:39,690
How dare you claim to be seeking trouble?

19
00:00:39,690 --> 00:00:41,570
It really looks like a pig with a green onion stuck in its nose

20
00:00:43,390 --> 00:00:44,350
old guy

21
00:00:44,350 --> 00:00:45,670
A certain family gives you good advice

22
00:00:45,670 --> 00:00:46,630
You don't know what is good and what is bad

23
00:00:46,630 --> 00:00:47,710
You like to laugh, right?

24
00:00:47,710 --> 00:00:49,030
Someone will make you cry now

25
00:00:54,290 --> 00:00:55,210
old guy

26
00:00:55,210 --> 00:00:57,410
Didn’t you laugh just now and cry?

27
00:00:57,410 --> 00:00:58,410
A certain family will spare you

28
00:00:58,410 --> 00:01:00,200
Don't even think about it

29
00:01:00,200 --> 00:01:03,710
Not yet?
